帮我把这段 Python 代码改写成函数式的 Scala 风格：

def find_users(users, min_age):
    result = []
    for u in users:
        if u.get('age') and u['age'] >= min_age:
            name = u.get('nickname') or u['name']
            result.append(name.upper())
    return sorted(set(result))

样本数据：[{"name":"ada","age":30},{"nickname":"bob","name":"robert","age":17},{"name":"ada","age":31}]，min_age=18。希望用模式匹配和 Option 处理缺字段的情况。
